WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.919 position:63%
[woman speaking Ukrainian]
<i>Her teacher called me to come to school.</i>

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.879
<i>She said my daughter was crying,</i>

00:00:04.963 --> 00:00:08.007 position:58%
<i>saying she'd be sent back and killed.</i>

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:10.218 position:59%
<i>All the kids in the class were crying.</i>

00:00:10.301 --> 00:00:12.595 position:66%
<i>The teacher didn't know what was going on.</i>

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:20.979
[man speaking Ukrainian]
<i>Soon she was rejecting food,</i>

00:00:21.062 --> 00:00:23.356
<i>and then she stopped responding
in general.</i>

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:25.734
We don't know how this happened.

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:29.738
<i>She was an athlete, went running,</i>

00:00:29.821 --> 00:00:33.575
<i>was active at school.</i>

00:00:33.658 --> 00:00:35.744 position:58%
[man speaking English] <i>The immigrants
that developed the condition</i>

00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:37.746
<i>seem to come
from certain parts of the world.</i>

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:39.539
<i>These children and their families</i>

00:00:39.622 --> 00:00:42.500
<i>have almost exclusively
been subject to trauma.</i>

00:00:46.796 --> 00:00:50.175
[man speaking Ukrainian]
<i>By the time we got to Sweden,</i>

00:00:50.258 --> 00:00:56.139
<i>my son was under
a tremendous amount of stress.</i>

00:00:58.266 --> 00:01:00.435
[woman speaking English]
<i>The children have seen a lot.</i>

00:01:00.518 --> 00:01:02.604
[man speaking English]
<i>We're talking about children</i>

00:01:02.687 --> 00:01:05.940 position:58%
<i>who are really sick in a serious way.</i>

00:01:06.816 --> 00:01:08.735
[woman speaking English]
<i>When I do the examination,</i>

00:01:08.818 --> 00:01:11.196
<i>I tell the parents that,
"You are the ones</i>

00:01:11.279 --> 00:01:14.282
<i>who are suffering
because of her condition.</i>

00:01:14.991 --> 00:01:16.993
<i>This is a way of protection.</i>

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:22.207
<i>She is just waiting
for the situation to be better."</i>

